<title>USA: IMM currency futures end mostly higher.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures end mostly higher.</headline>
<text>
<p>June 11 -Most IMM currency futures ended higher. Tone remains bullish in Sept yen. Resistance is at $0.009174 and at $0.009260. Sept marks failed to extend gains, and are expected to trade in ranges ahead of Amsterdam summit. U.S. May retail sales on Thursday seen rising 0.4 pct, from down 0.3 pct. ((DerivativesDesk(312)408-8750))</p>
